<div id="A1.SS1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p9.1" class="ltx_p">In parallel, when the receiver returns the PCN claim requested by the LLM, a claim aggregation process is applied to capture the claim, which can be used during verification.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p10.1" class="ltx_p">The TypeScript function below shows how the PCN payload from the retriever is aggregated to create a map of claims that the verifier can use to verify the claims in the response generated by the LLM.</p>
</div>
