<div id="A1.SS1.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p12.1" class="ltx_p">Now that the LLM has generated a response, we execute the PCN-verifier module to assess if claims have been made and then validate if any.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p13.1" class="ltx_p">The TypeScript function below shows how the PCN protocol can be implemented to process the response generated by an LLM. This example implements the exact policy variant.</p>
</div>
