<figure id="A1.F3" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.06902v1/img/sample-pcn-warn.png" id="A1.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:548/587;" width="548" height="587" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Illustration of the Proof-Carrying Numbers (PCN) protocol in an LLM chat application, where the response of the LLM (5.69%) didn’t meet the exact policy set in the verification. A clear warning mark is added that hints to users to review the output.</figcaption>
</figure>
